# API (stack)

Etalon: `src/4_modules/Auth/data/Otp.api.ts` + `model/Otp.interactor.ts`.

- Network code lives in the slice `data/` segment as an API class (`XxxApi`). Construct `Mutation`/`Query` from `mobx-tanstack-query` with `queryClient` from `~core/api`, `abortSignal`, a `mutationKey`/`queryKey`, and `mutationFn` that calls `HttpClient` from `~shared/api`.
- The interactor in `model/` is the only consumer of the API class. Presentation never imports `data/`.
- Don't fire fetches in effects. Don't copy server results into MobX observables (see `stack/model`).
- Validate with Zod schemas in `model/` (`*.schema.ts`) — form input/output types via `z.input` / `z.output`. Generated schemas from Kubb stay behind adapters (see `stack/general`, the `openapi-codegen` skill).
- Mock with MSW (`~msw`); keep mocks aligned with Zod schemas and the OpenAPI spec.
